{"seq":1,"slug":"computability","title":"可计算性","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/alan-turing/ideas-and-methods/computability","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-limits-of-computation","title":"计算的界限","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/alan-turing/ideas-and-methods/computability/the-limits-of-computation","wordCount":1914,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-halting-problem","title":"停机问题","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/alan-turing/ideas-and-methods/computability/the-halting-problem","wordCount":1779,"readingTime":8}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"可计算性\">可计算性</h1><p>本章阐述图灵关于可计算性的思想。图灵，深刻地揭示了&quot;计算的界限&quot;，证明了并非一切问题都可计算；&quot;停机问题&quot;,则是他揭示计算界限的经典例证。两篇文档，分别阐述计算的界限，以及停机问题。</p>\n"}